# Phase 14a (#64, docs/phase14a-brief.md 7 A2): Classification: a video is in no music list; an audio .mp4 is a song, an m4b with image chapters a book
#   SIM_BUILD=build/sim-ui-video scripts/shots.sh tests/ui/ipodui-p14a-classify.script
# (ipodui-p14a-* default to build/sim-ui-video; the gate runs them there)
# needs: video
# timeout: 180
#
# Disk: tests/fixtures/videos/mkvideos.sh (installed by the gate's prime
# step, or by shots.sh for a standalone run):
#   Movies/        Audio First  High Profile  Late Chapter  Short Film
#   TV Shows/      Show A (S1 x2, S2 x2, tagged)  Show B (S1 x2, untagged)
#   Misc/          Show.C.S01E02.m4v  S01E03.m4v (nameless)
#   Podcasts/Pod One/  Audio Episode.m4a  Video Episode.m4v
#   Music/         Fixture Singer/Audio Only.mp4 (a song)
#                  Fixture Author/Image Book.m4b (a book)
# Main menu with Videos on (T1 default): Music, Videos, Podcasts, Extras,
# Settings, Shuffle Songs. Videos: Movies, TV Shows, Settings.
# Music (this library): Playlists, Artists, Albums, Songs, Genres,
# Composers, Audiobooks, Search.

# golden: skip shuffle_songs shuffle_albums
# trace: shuf
# The audio-only Audio Only.mp4 stays in Songs; Image Book.m4b (an mjpeg
# chapter-image trak, not avc1) stays in Audiobooks. No video file is in
# Songs, Albums, Artists, Genres, Composers, Shuffle Songs, Shuffle Albums
# or Search ("audio" finds the song Audio Only, never the movie Audio
# First). Shuffle: the queue holds the music songs only (the queued count
# below is the mini library's songs plus Audio Only; a video or podcast
# would raise it), and no track change starts the video player.
# log: shuf: start songs ok queued=6
# log: shuf: mode albums ok src=albums
# log: search screen q=5 n=4 pl=0
# ("audio": the Search row, Audio Episode, the album and the song Audio
# Only; the movie Audio First would make it n=5)
wait 4000
wait_db 45000
art_wait 60000
repeat off
key SELECT          # Music
wait 900
shot music_menu
wheel +3 300        # Songs
wait 400
key SELECT
wait 1200
shot songs          # Audio Only among the songs; no video titles
wheel +30 300
wait 600
shot songs_end      # the end of the list: no Short Film / Show A
key MENU
wait 700
wheel -2 300        # Artists
wait 400
key SELECT
wait 1200
shot artists        # Fixture Singer, Square Wave Quartet, Tone Collective
key MENU
wait 700
wheel +1 300        # Albums
wait 400
key SELECT
wait 1200
shot albums         # no movie or show among the albums
key MENU
wait 700
wheel +2 300        # Genres
wait 400
key SELECT
wait 1200
shot genres
key MENU
wait 700
wheel +2 300        # Audiobooks
wait 400
key SELECT
wait 1200
shot audiobooks     # Mini Audiobook and Image Book
key MENU
wait 700
wheel +1 300        # Search
wait 400
key SELECT
wait 900
type audio
wait 1500
shot search_audio   # Audio Only (song), never Audio First (movie)
key MENU            # the letter picker
wait 700
key MENU            # Search
wait 700
key MENU            # Music
wait 900
key MENU            # main menu
wait 900

wheel +5 300        # Shuffle Songs (after Settings)
wait 400
key SELECT
wait_pos 100 20000
expect_video 0 none
shot shuffle_songs
key NEXT
wait 800
key NEXT
wait 800
key NEXT
wait 800
expect_video 0 none
key PLAY            # pause; Now Playing's shelf: Shuffle > Albums
wait 300
key SELECT
wait 500
key SELECT
wait 500
key SELECT
wait 700
wheel +2 300        # Albums
wait 300
key SELECT          # commit
wait 2500
shot shuffle_albums
key PLAY
wait 500
key NEXT
wait 800
key NEXT
wait 800
expect_video 0 none
audio_stop
wait 500
